<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Stash-VR</title>
    <link href="{{.Base}}/icon.png" rel="icon" type="image/png"/>
</head>
<body>
<h1><img src="{{.Base}}/icon.png" style="vertical-align: middle;" alt="">Stash-VR</h1>
<main>
    <h2>Loading...</h2>
    <p>This is the HereSphere library address. Opened in HereSphere, the library takes the place of this page.</p>
    <p>In an ordinary browser only this page ever shows: HereSphere asks for the library behind the scenes. <a href="{{.Base}}/">Open the Stash-VR launch page</a> for the addresses of each player and to check the connection to Stash.</p>
</main>
<footer><p><a href="https://github.com/skeel-x/stash-vr" target="_blank">https://github.com/skeel-x/stash-vr</a>, based on <a href="https://github.com/o-fl0w/stash-vr" target="_blank">o-fl0w/stash-vr</a></p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
